    "title": "Timebomb Prank, Gun Simulator",
    "description": "Want some fun with jokes and games? Check out \"Timebomb Prank, Gun Simulator\"! We give you cool stuff like time bombs, fake cracks on the screen, and electric or fire touches. Plus, we've got loads of gun simulations, like real guns and tasers.\r\n\r\nDownload the game now to prank your pals or just have fun shooting guns. We made it all for you!\r\n\r\nWhy pick our game? Here are the main features:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca3 Fake bomb prank with cracked screen: Open the app, pick a bomb type, and watch a big bang with a cracked screen. Fool your friends with this funny fake bomb!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Crack Screen: Start the crack screen feature and pass your phone to someone. They'll think the screen's broken!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf1 Fire - Electric Touch: Activate the fire or electric screen and watch their reaction when they touch it. They'll be shocked, but be careful they don't drop the phone! LOL\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd2b Gun simulator: Choose from a variety of guns, each with its own sound. Tap to shoot and pick your favorite weapon skin. You can even choose firing modes like single, burst, hold, or shake. Explore different shooting scenarios and enjoy the authentic gun sounds!\r\n\r\nSupport us!\r\nWe're always looking to improve our apps, so send us your thoughts through the feedback form in the app settings. We want to make your phone experience awesome! \ud83d\ude0e",
